  "id": "notebook-to-live",
  "after": "overview",
  "title": "Deployment: from your laptop to everyone.",
  "caption": "Before deployment, the model lives in a notebook that only you can run. After deployment, it sits on a server behind one web address. Any app can send a request in JSON (a simple text format for data) and get a reply in JSON. The numbers are a made-up fraud check on a ₹1,200 payment.",
  "alt": "Top: a box labelled notebook on your laptop, only you can use it. An arrow labelled deploy leads to a server that is always on, with the model and an API at the address POST /predict. Three apps, a phone app, a website and a WhatsApp bot, each send a request up to the server and get a reply back. A legend shows a request {\"amount\": 1200} and a reply {\"fraud\": 0.03}.",
  "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 396\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><text x=\"16\" y=\"18\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" font-weight=\"700\" letter-spacing=\"1.5\">Before</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"26\" width=\"328\" height=\"54\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface2 s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Notebook on your laptop</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"68\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">Only you can use it.</text><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"82\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"109\" class=\"s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><polygon points=\"180,116 175.6,108 184.4,108\" class=\"f-indigo\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"14\" class=\"f-indigo\" font-weight=\"700\">deploy</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" font-weight=\"700\" letter-spacing=\"1.5\">After</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"118\" width=\"328\" height=\"78\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-indigo-soft s-indigo\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Server: always on, online</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"13\">model + API at one address</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"mono\" font-weight=\"700\" style=\"font-size:13px\">POST /predict</text><line x1=\"57.7\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"57.7\" y2=\"206\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"57.7,200 61.5,207 53.8,207\" class=\"f-muted\"/><line x1=\"75.7\" y1=\"198\" x2=\"75.7\" y2=\"244\" class=\"s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"75.7,250 71.8,243 79.5,243\" class=\"f-ok\"/><rect x=\"16\" y=\"252\" width=\"101.3\" height=\"36\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"66.7\" y=\"275\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">Phone app</text><line x1=\"171\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"171\" y2=\"206\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"171,200 174.8,207 167.1,207\" class=\"f-muted\"/><line x1=\"189\" y1=\"198\" x2=\"189\" y2=\"244\" class=\"s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"189,250 185.1,243 192.8,243\" class=\"f-ok\"/><rect x=\"129.3\" y=\"252\" width=\"101.3\" height=\"36\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"275\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">Website</text><line x1=\"284.3\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"284.3\" y2=\"206\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"284.3,200 288.2,207 280.5,207\" class=\"f-muted\"/><line x1=\"302.3\" y1=\"198\" x2=\"302.3\" y2=\"244\" class=\"s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"302.3,250 298.5,243 306.2,243\" class=\"f-ok\"/><rect x=\"242.7\" y=\"252\" width=\"101.3\" height=\"36\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"293.3\" y=\"275\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"600\">WhatsApp bot</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"314\" width=\"328\" height=\"74\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface2\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><line x1=\"28\" y1=\"336\" x2=\"28\" y2=\"322\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"28,320 31.3,326 24.7,326\" class=\"f-muted\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"336\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">request:</text><text x=\"102\" y=\"336\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:13px\">{\"amount\": 1200}</text><line x1=\"28\" y1=\"354\" x2=\"28\" y2=\"368\" class=\"s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"28,372 24.7,366 31.3,366\" class=\"f-ok\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"368\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">reply:</text><text x=\"102\" y=\"368\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:13px\">{\"fraud\": 0.03}</text></svg>"
